{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c7fd","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0d474-3d76-7560-9284-b023a445b4ff"},"sequence":601,"recorded_at":1780531400001197,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"e42e0c3d-9a3a-49fd-b4d5-0c8bade5fc27","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"e42e0c3d-9a3a-49fd-b4d5-0c8bade5fc27","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"e42e0c3d-9a3a-49fd-b4d5-0c8bade5fc27"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0d476-db69-7cd3-b3f1-18e00e79a8e8"},"task_id":"01a0d476-db69-7cd3-b3f1-18e00e79a8e8","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0d476-db69-7cd3-b3f1-18e00e79a8e8","chunk":"Read text file `/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.temp/STORY-260830-21bxa3/worktree/internal/clonereadback/TRACEABILITY.md`.\n1|# TRACEABILITY — internal/clonereadback\n2|\n3|Fourth leaf of STORY-260830-21bxa3 (M4): Clone Read-Back Evidence\n4|Manifest 1.0.0 and Clone Validation Report 1.0.0 as closed schemas\n5|with JCS identities, pinned to SPEC v0.7.0 §13.14.2. Reconciliation\n6|completeness and the Story registry belong to the final leaf\n7|(TASK-260830-1esv6u); this package gates each shape closed and\n8|internally coherent, never across inputs.\n9|\n10|Authority quotes below come from\n11|`internal/specdoc/SPEC.v0.7.0.md` (pinned v0.7.0). Line numbers are\n12|1-based.\n13|\n14|## Axis inventory (written first)\n15|\n16|Every gate axis the conformance matrix walks, with its domain:\n17|\n18|| Axis | Domain | Oracle |\n19||---|---|---|\n20|| A1 shape members | every member of readback (16), evidence (5), report (23), derived by reflection over the input types | missing/extra/duplicated/miscased/wrong-type refused with the member literal at every entry |\n21|| A2 schema/version | the two literal pairs from the registry (lines 170-171) | sibling URNs, 2.0.0/1.0 versions refused |\n22|| A3 read-back mode | staged\\|live (line 10739) | 17 closed members + neighbors incl. invalid UTF-8 refused at Build, Decode, predicate |\n23|| A4 evidence kind | native_sample\\|parser_trace\\|marker_observation (lines 10748-10751) | 3 closed + 14 neighbors refused at Build, Decode, predicate |\n24|| A5 native-ID equality | equal vs unequal vs empty pairs | equal seals; unequal refuses (read-back) / decides valid=false (report) |\n25|| A6 valid rule | 2^7 check outcomes × ID eq/neq × 6 finding classes = 1536 combos | decided bit seals, flipped bit refuses, at Build and Decode |\n26|| A7 string bounds | [1..512] native IDs/heads, [1..128] media, chars not bytes | 0/1/512/513 and 127/128/129 ASCII + multibyte at edge |\n27|| A8 heads order | sorted unique [0..1024] | unsorted/dup/overlong refuse; 1024 admits, 1025 refuses |\n28|| A9 evidence order | sorted unique by (kind, blob) | 6 permutations admit 1; same-kind blob order; dup refuses |\n29|| A10 counts | evidence [0..65536], findings [0..4096] | 0/edge admit, edge+1 refuses at both entries |\n30|| A11 uint53/number | canonical integers, 2^53-1 max | 2^53, float, exponent, string, bool, null refuse |\n31|| A12 scalars | UUIDv7 operation, sha256 digests | v4/malformed refuse |\n32|| A13 owner nesting | tuple/binding/findings documents | broken nested docs refuse with owner detail at every entry |\n33|| A14 extensions | reverse-DNS closed | open keys refuse at every entry |\n34|| A15 identity | JCS digest omitting only the self member | independent recompute agrees; other-member omission disagrees; tamper refuses; relabel refuses |\n35|| A16 UTF-8 | every Build-side string (7+4+9 derived fields) + heads + extensions | lone/trailing invalid bytes refuse with the member literal |\n36|| A17 ownership | 8 exports, 0 carrying fidelity/plan rows | row census empty; reachability to landed owners; no fork literals/selectors/imports |\n37|\n38|## Clause map (spec sentence → gate → test)\n39|\n40|| # | Pinned clause | Gate | Production site | Test |\n41||---|---|---|---|---|\n42|| C1 | \"Clone Read-Back Evidence Manifest 1.0.0 contains exactly its schema/version\" + 15 members (10737-10747) | closed shape, 16 members | `DecodeReadBackEvidenceManifest`, `buildReadBackManifest` renders | `TestMemberCensus*` (readback/evidence) |\n43|| C2 | \"`read_back_evidence_manifest_id` under the omission rule\" (10738) | JCS identity | `Build…` seals, `verifySelfDigest` | `TestReadBackIdentityIndependent` |\n44|| C3 | \"`mode:staged\\|live`\" (10739) | closed mode | `ValidReadBackMode`, both entries | `TestModeVocabularyOracle` |\n45|| C4 | \"equal expected and observed native Session IDs\" (10741-10742) | equality | `checkNativeIdentityMatch`, both entries | `TestNativeIdentityEqualityOracle` |\n46|| C5 | \"`observed_environment:EnvironmentTuple`\" (10742) | owner tuple | `sessadapter.DecodeTuple` at both entries | `TestOwnerDelegation` |\n47|| C6 | \"`parsed_event_count:uint53`\" (10743) | uint53, no derivation (bound) | `checkUint53Bounds` / `> maxUint53` | `TestScalarGates`, `TestParsedCountAndStructuralDigestAreStatedBounds` |\n48|| C7 | \"`parsed_head_ids:sorted unique string[1..512][0..1024]`\" (10744) | sorted-unique | `checkSortedUniqueBoundedStrings` / environ | `TestParsedHeadIDsSweep` |\n49|| C8 | \"`workspace_binding:WorkspaceBinding`\" (10745) | owner binding | `clonebundle.DecodeWorkspaceBinding` | `TestOwnerDelegation` |\n50|| C9 | \"`structural_digest:digest`\" (10746) | digest, no derivation (bound) | `scalar.ParseDigest` / `checkDigest` | `TestScalarGates`, stated-bound test |\n51|| C10 | \"`evidence_objects:EvidenceObject[0..65536]`\" (10747) | count + row shape | `checkEvidenceCount`, row build/decode | `TestEvidenceCountEdges`, census |\n52|| C11 | \"`EvidenceObject` contains exactly…\" (10748-10751) | 5-member row, closed kind | `buildEvidenceObject`, `decodeEvidenceObject` | `TestMemberCensus*` (evidence), kind oracle |\n53|| C12 | \"Evidence rows are sorted unique by evidence kind/blob ID.\" (10752) | row order | `checkEvidenceOrder`, both entries | `TestEvidenceOrderSweep` |\n54|| C13 | \"Staged and live manifests are distinct and cannot be relabeled.\" (10753-10754) + \"Modes cannot be relabeled.\" (10580) | mode binds identity | identity covers mode | `TestModeRelabelRefused`, `TestModeBindsIdentity` |\n55|| C14 | \"`schema=urn:ax:schema:clone-validation-report`, `schema_version=1.0.0`\" (10756-10758) + 20 members (10758-10776) | closed shape, 23 members | `DecodeValidationReport`, `buildValidationReport` renders | `TestMemberCensus*` (report) |\n56|| C15 | \"`validation_report_id:digest` under the omission rule\" (10759) | JCS identity | `Build…` seals, `verifySelfDigest` | `TestReportIdentityIndependent` |\n57|| C16 | six manifest/fidelity digest refs + operation UUID (10760-10765) | opaque refs (no cross-check; reconciliation owns pairing) | scalar gates | `TestScalarGates` |\n58|| C17 | expected/observed IDs `string[1..512]` (10766-10767) | bounds; equality decides valid | bound gates + `decideValid` | string edges, valid oracle |\n59|| C18 | \"`target_environment:EnvironmentTuple`\" (10768) | owner tuple (cross-match is reconciliation) | `sessadapter.DecodeTuple` | `TestOwnerDelegation`, `TestReportTupleMatchIsReconciliationBound` |\n60|| C19 | seven check booleans (10769-10774) | required non-null booleans | `decodeValidationChecks` / Go bools | wrong-type census (null probe), oracle |\n61|| C20 | \"`findings:AdapterFinding[0..4096]`\" (10775) | owner findings + count | `sessadapter.DecodeFindings(·, 4096)` | `TestFindingsCountEdges`, delegation |\n62|| C21 | \"`valid=true` requires every boolean true, matching native IDs/tuple, and no error finding.\" (10776-10777) + \"every applicable check must pass\" (10582) | valid iff all-true ∧ IDs equal ∧ no error (tuple cross-match → reconciliation) | `decideValid` + `checkValidAgreement`, both entries | `TestValidWholeDomainOracle` (1536 combos) |\n63|| C22 | \"`extensions`\" on both shapes + registry URNs at 1.0.0 (170-171) | closed extensions, literal envelope | `clonebundle` extensions owner | `TestExtensionsClosed`, `TestEnvelopeLiterals` |\n64|\n65|Member-name derivation note: the pinned text states the\n66|read-back native-ID RULE (\"equal expected and observed native\n67|Session IDs\") without member names; the member names\n68|`expected/observed_target_native_session_id` follow the\n69|validation-report table (C17) and the read-back adapter success\n70|body (line 3843: `observed_target_native_session_id`), which spell\n71|both. The census exact-set test fails if production drifts from\n72|this spelling.\n73|\n74|## Gate × entry table\n75|\n76|Every production entry that reaches a gate is its own cell. B =\n77|Build refuses/admits, D = Decode refuses/admits, P = predicate.\n78|\n79|| Gate | BuildReadBack | DecodeReadBack | BuildReport | DecodeReport | Predicates |\n80||---|---|---|---|---|---|\n81|| closed members (A1) | renders exact¹ | refuses | renders exact¹ | refuses | — |\n82|| schema/version literals (A2) | renders | refuses | renders | refuses | — |\n83|| mode vocab (A3) | refuses | refuses | — | — | `ValidReadBackMode` |\n84|| evidence kind vocab (A4) | refuses | refuses | — | — | `ValidEvidenceKind` |\n85|| native-ID equality (A5) | refuses | refuses | decides | decides | — |\n86|| valid rule (A5/A6) | — | — | refuses flipped | refuses flipped | — |\n87|| string bounds chars (A7) | refuses | refuses | refuses | refuses | — |\n88|| heads order (A8) | refuses | refuses (owner) | — | — | — |\n89|| evidence order (A9) | refuses | refuses | — | — | — |\n90|| evidence count (A10) | refuses | refuses | — | — | — |\n91|| findings count (A10) | — | — | refuses (owner max) | refuses (owner max) | — |\n92|| uint53/number (A11) | refuses | refuses (owner) | — | — | — |\n93|| scalars (A12) | refuses | refuses | refuses | refuses | — |\n94|| owner nesting (A13) | refuses w/ owner detail | refuses w/ owner detail | refuses w/ owner detail | refuses w/ owner detail | — |\n95|| extensions (A14) | refuses |